exports[`DetailPanel dispatch matrix > renders coral-acid-exposure after data loads 1`] = `
<div>
  <div
    aria-label="Feature details"
    aria-live="polite"
  >
    <div
      class="fixed z-overlay w-80 max-h-[80vh] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface-primary shadow-2xl"
      style="left: 688px; top: 60px;"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b border-white/5 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing select-none"
      >
        <span
          class="text-white/65 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 font-sans truncate pr-2 mb-0"
        >
          Coral Acidification Exposure
        </span>
        <button
          aria-label="Close"
          class="text-white/60 hover:text-white text-lg leading-none transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          ×
        </button>
      </div>
      <div
        class="px-4 py-4"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-3 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 border-orange-500/20 border"
        >
          <p
            class="text-orange-400 text-[14px] font-sans"
          >
            Exposure, not loss. A corrosive reading means the seafloor sits in water undersaturated with respect to aragonite — cold-water corals are documented living below the saturation horizon, calcifying at a metabolic cost. This is not a prediction of habitat loss. Both inputs are modeled: our own MaxEnt coral-suitability model and a 1°×1° saturation climatology. "Today" is GLODAP's mapped reference year, nominally ~2002, so this compares two climatology snapshots — it is not a rate or trend.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span
          class="inline-block text-[14px] font-mono border rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 mb-2 text-rose-300 border-rose-500/40"
        >
          Coral Acidification Exposure (modeled)
        </span>
        <p
          class="text-sm text-white/80 mb-3"
        >
          1.23
          °, 
          4.56
          °
        </p>
        <div
          class="mb-4"
        >
          <p
            class="text-white/65 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 font-sans"
          >
            This cell
          </p>
          <div
            class="overflow-x-auto rounded border border-white/10"
          >
            <table
              class="w-full text-[11px] font-mono"
            >
              <tbody>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    State
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    Newly corrosive (since preindustrial)
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Seafloor depth
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    2500 m
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Aragonite horizon (today)
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    2400 m
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Aragonite horizon (preindustrial)
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    3200 m
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    VME suitability
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    0.550
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mb-4"
        >
          <p
            class="text-white/65 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 font-sans"
          >
            Regional summary (suitability-weighted)
          </p>
          <div
            class="overflow-x-auto rounded border border-white/10 mb-2"
          >
            <table
              class="w-full text-[11px] font-mono"
            >
              <tbody>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Exposed (any corrosive)
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    31.0%
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Newly corrosive (since preindustrial)
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-rose-300"
                  >
                    22.0%
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-[11px] text-white/60 mb-1"
          >
            Threshold sensitivity (suitability cutoff):
          </p>
          <div
            class="overflow-x-auto rounded border border-white/10"
          >
            <table
              class="w-full text-[11px] font-mono"
            >
              <thead
                class="sticky top-0 bg-black/70 text-white/70"
              >
                <tr>
                  <th
                    class="text-left px-2 py-1 font-normal"
