          Ocean Oxygen
        </span>
        <p
          class="text-sm text-white/80 mb-3"
        >
          Nearest 0.5° cell · 
          1.23
          °, 
          4.56
          ° · 
          100
           m
        </p>
        <div
          class="mb-3 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 border-orange-500/20 border"
        >
          <p
            class="text-orange-400 text-[14px] font-sans"
          >
            The recent field (Argo optodes, 2014–2018) and the ~1980s baseline (ship Winkler/CTD) differ in instrument and method, so some apparent change reflects that difference, not a real oxygen trend.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mb-4"
        >
