            </span>
            <span
              class="text-white/90 text-[14px] text-right font-mono"
            >
              210.1 µmol/kg
            </span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-1.5 border-b border-white/5 last:border-0"
          >
            <span
              class="text-white/70 text-[14px] shrink-0"
            >
              Δ change
            </span>
            <span
              class="text-white/90 text-[14px] text-right font-mono"
            >
              -14.7 µmol/kg (loss)
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p
          class="text-[11px] text-white/65 mt-2"
        >
          Source:
           
          <a
            class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline"
