        class="px-4 py-4"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-3 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 border-orange-500/20 border"
        >
          <p
            class="text-orange-400 text-[14px] font-sans"
          >
            MODELED, not observed. Relative habitat suitability for VME indicator corals — not probability of presence, not evidence that species are here.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span
          class="inline-block text-[14px] font-mono border rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 mb-2 text-violet-300 border-violet-500/40"
        >
          VME Suitability (modeled)
        </span>
        <p
          class="text-sm text-white/80 mb-2"
        >
          1.23
          °, 
          4.56
          °
        </p>
        <div
          class="mb-4"
        >
          <p
            class="text-white/65 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 font-sans"
          >
            Model output
          </p>
          <div
            class="overflow-x-auto rounded border border-white/10"
          >
            <table
              class="w-full text-[11px] font-mono"
            >
              <tbody>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Suitability
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-violet-300"
                  >
                    0.620
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Uncertainty
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-violet-300"
                  >
                    0.080
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mb-4"
        >
          <p
            class="text-white/65 text-[13px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1.5 font-sans"
          >
            Top predictors
          </p>
          <div
            class="overflow-x-auto rounded border border-white/10"
          >
            <table
              class="w-full text-[11px] font-mono"
            >
              <tbody>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Depth
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-white/70"
                  >
                    2500.00
                     m
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Temperature
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-white/70"
                  >
                    3.10
                     °C
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr
                  class="odd:bg-white/[0.025]"
                >
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-white/85"
                  >
                    Substrate
                  </td>
                  <td
                    class="px-2 py-0.5 text-right text-white/70"
                  >
                    1.00
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p
          class="text-[11px] text-white/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed"
        >
          A MaxEnt model trained on NOAA DSCRTP coral occurrences and seafloor environmental predictors (GEBCO, WOA23, ISAS20, GLODAP, substrate).
        </p>
        <button
          class="mt-2 text-[12px] text-cyan-300/90 hover:text-cyan-200 underline decoration-dotted"
        >
